":"מִשְׁאָלָה","xlit":"mishʼâlâh","gloss":"desire, petition.","def":"a request"},"H4863":{"lemma":"מִשְׁאֶרֶת","xlit":"mishʼereth","gloss":"kneading trough, store.","def":"a kneading-trough (in which the dough rises)"},"H4864":{"lemma":"מַשְׂאֵת","xlit":"masʼêth","gloss":"burden, collection, sign of fire, (great) flame, gift, lifting up, mess, oblation, reward.","def":"properly, (abstractly) a raising (as of the hands in prayer), or rising (of flame); figuratively, an utterance; concretely, a beacon (as raised); a present (as taken), mess, or tribute; figuratively, a reproach (as a burden)"},"H4865":{"lemma":"מִשְׁבְּצָה","xlit":"mishbᵉtsâh","gloss":"ouch, wrought.","def":"a brocade; by analogy, a (reticulated) setting of agem"},"H4866":{"lemma":"מִשְׁבֵּר","xlit":"mishbêr","gloss":"birth, breaking forth.","def":"the orifice of the womb (from which the fetus breaks forth)"},"H4867":{"lemma":"מִשְׁבָּר","xlit":"mishbâr","gloss":"billow, wave.","def":"a breaker (of the sea)"},"H4868":{"lemma":"מִשְׁבָּת","xlit":"mishbâth","gloss":"sabbath.","def":"cessation, i.e. destruction"},"H4869":{"lemma":"מִשְׂגָּב","xlit":"misgâb","gloss":"Misgab.","def":"defence, high fort (tower), refuge, Misgab, a place in Moab"},"H4870":{"lemma":"מִשְׁגֶּה","xlit":"mishgeh","gloss":"oversight.","def":"an error"},"H4871":{"lemma":"מָשָׁה","xlit":"mâshâh","gloss":"draw(out).","def":"to pull out (literally or figuratively)"},"H4872":{"lemma":"מֹשֶׁה","xlit":"Môsheh","gloss":"Moses.","def":"Mosheh, the Israelite lawgiver"},"H4873":{"lemma":"מֹשֶׁה","xlit":"Môsheh","gloss":"Moses.","def":"{Mosheh, the Israelite lawgiver}"},"H4874":{"lemma":"מַשֶּׁה","xlit":"mashsheh","gloss":"[phrase] creditor.","def":"a debt"},"H4875":{"lemma":"מְשׁוֹאָה","xlit":"mᵉshôwʼâh","gloss":"desolation, waste.","def":"(a) ruin, abstractly (the act) or concretely (the wreck)"},"H4876":{"lemma":"מַשּׁוּאָה","xlit":"mashshûwʼâh","gloss":"desolation, destruction.","def":"ruin"},"H4877":{"lemma":"מְשׁוֹבָב","xlit":"Mᵉshôwbâb","gloss":"Meshobab.","def":"Meshobab, an Israelite"},"H4878":{"lemma":"מְשׁוּבָה","xlit":"mᵉshûwbâh","gloss":"backsliding, turning away.","def":"apostasy"},"H4879":{"lemma":"מְשׁוּגָה","xlit":"mᵉshûwgâh","gloss":"error.","def":"mistake"},"H4880":{"lemma":"מָשׁוֹט","xlit":"mâshôwṭ","gloss":"oar.","def":"an oar"},"H4881":{"lemma":"מְשׂוּכָה","xlit":"mᵉsûwkâh","gloss":"hedge.","def":"a hedge"},"H4882":{"lemma":"מְשׁוּסָה","xlit":"mᵉshûwçâh","gloss":"spoil.","def":"spoilation"},"H4883":{"lemma":"מַשּׂוֹר","xlit":"massôwr","gloss":"saw.","def":"a saw"},"H4884":{"lemma":"מְשׂוּרָה","xlit":"mᵉsûwrâh","gloss":"measure.","def":"a measure (for liquids)"},"H4885":{"lemma":"מָשׂוֹשׂ","xlit":"mâsôws","gloss":"joy, mirth, rejoice.","def":"delight, concretely (the cause or object) or abstractly (the feeling)"},"H4886":{"lemma":"מָשַׁח","xlit":"mâshach","gloss":"anoint, paint.","def":"to rub with oil, i.e. to anoint; by implication, to consecrate; also to paint"},"H4887":{"lemma":"מְשַׁח","xlit":"mᵉshach","gloss":"oil.","def":"oil"},"H4888":{"lemma":"מִשְׁחָה","xlit":"mishchâh","gloss":"(to be) anointed(-ing), ointment.","def":"unction (the act); by implication, a consecratory gift"},"H4889":{"lemma":"מַשְׁחִית","xlit":"mashchîyth","gloss":"corruption, (to) destroy(-ing), destruction, trap, [idiom] utterly.","def":"destructive, i.e. (as noun) destruction, literally (specifically a snare) or figuratively (corruption)"},"H4890":{"lemma":"מִשְׂחַק","xlit":"mischaq","gloss":"scorn.","def":"a laughing-stock"},"H4891":{"lemma":"מִשְׁחָר","xlit":"mishchâr","gloss":"morning.","def":"dawn"},"H4892":{"lemma":"מַשְׁחֵת","xlit":"mashchêth","gloss":"destroying.","def":"destruction"},"H4893":{"lemma":"מִשְׁחָת","xlit":"mishchâth","gloss":"corruption, marred.","def":"disfigurement"},"H4894":{"lemma":"מִשְׁטוֹחַ","xlit":"mishṭôwach","gloss":"(to) spread (forth, -ing, upon).","def":"a spreading-place"},"H4895":{"lemma":"מַשְׂטֵמָה","xlit":"masṭêmâh","gloss":"hatred.","def":"enmity"},"H4896":{"lemm